<body>
<header class="hdr">
  <div class="hdr-in">
    <a href="/" class="hdr-logo">
      <span class="hdr-pill"><span class="hdr-dot"></span>LIVE</span>
      <span class="hdr-name">PULSE</span>
    </a>
    <a href="/sponsor" class="hdr-cta">✦ Advertise</a>
  </div>
</header>
<section class="hero">
  <div class="pillar-brand">
    <img class="pillar-hero-logo" src="/pulse-franchises-logo.svg?v=tt1" alt="PULSE Franchises" onerror="this.style.display='none';var f=document.getElementById('pillar-brand-fallback');if(f)f.style.display='flex'">
    <div class="pillar-brand-fallback" id="pillar-brand-fallback" style="display:none">
      <img class="pbf-mark" src="/pulse-mark.svg" alt="">
      <span class="pbf-word">PULSE <em>FRANCHISES</em></span>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-eyebrow"><span class="hero-dot"></span>Franchises · Industry-level</div>
  <h1>Should you <em>open or buy that business?</em></h1>
  <p class="hero-sub">Should I open a snow-cone shop in 2027? Buy a Chick-fil-A franchise? Launch a cleaning business? Every fr#### entry walks through startup costs, unit economics, customer acquisition, and the real-operator decision tree.</p>
  <div class="hero-counts">🏪 <strong id="hc-total">…</strong> Franchise and business evaluations</div>
  <div style="margin-top:16px;"><a href="/franchise-leaderboard" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;padding:13px 24px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#FFD740,#FF8C1A);color:#1a0f00;font-weight:900;font-size:0.95rem;text-decoration:none;box-shadow:0 6px 22px rgba(251,191,36,.35);">🏆 Top Franchises to Open or Buy in 2027 — Ranked &rarr;</a></div>
</section>
<div class="toolbar">
  <div class="search-wrap">
    <span class="search-icon">🔍</span>
    <input class="search-input" id="q" type="search" placeholder="Search franchises and business ideas by industry or fr#### id" autocomplete="off">
    <button class="search-clear" id="qclear" aria-label="Clear search">×</button>
  </div>
  <div class="filters" id="filters"></div>
</div>
<div class="statusbar" id="status">
  <span><strong id="st-count">…</strong> entries shown</span>
  <span>Sorted newest first</span>
</div>
<div class="grid-wrap">
  <div class="grid" id="grid"><div class="loading"><div class="pulse-logo"><span class="pulse-dot"></span></div><div class="pulse-label">Loading playbooks<span class="pulse-dots">...</span></div><div class="pulse-skeleton"><div class="skel-card"></div><div class="skel-card"></div><div class="skel-card"></div><div class="skel-card"></div><div class="skel-card"></div><div class="skel-card"></div><div class="skel-card"></div><div class="skel-card"></div><div class="skel-card"></div></div></div></div>
  <div class="pager" id="pager"></div>
</div>
<footer class="footer">
  <div class="footer-in">
    <a href="#" class="footer-pill"><span class="footer-pill-dot"></span>Library · <span id="lp-num">live</span> entries</a>
    <div class="footer-pillars" id="lp-pillars"></div>
    <div class="footer-copy">© 2025 Kory White · PULSE RevOps · <a href="/">pulserevops.com</a> · <a href="/tools">🛠 Free Tools</a> · <a href="/sponsor">Advertise</a> · <a href="/my-content">My Content (initials + 4-digit code)</a> · <a href="https://calendly.com/korywhiterevops">Open to Chief Revenue Officer roles →</a></div>
  </div>
</footer>
<script>window.PILLAR_DEFAULT = 'fr';</script>
<script src="/js/pillar-page.js" defer></script>
<script src="/js/pulse-lead-track.js" defer></script>
